 final two. If One Nation beats one of them on primaries, the VEC will redo the preference count.","The Greens candidate is third on 13.2%. Greens voters overwhelmingly put One Nation last, which hurts it here."],"baseline":{"winner":{"candidate":"VALLENCE, Bridget","code":"LIB"},"holder":{"code":"LIB"},"final":[{"candidate":"VALLENCE, Bridget","code":"LIB","pct":51.95},{"candidate":"DENT, Lorna","code":"ALP","pct":35.2}],"margin":1.95,"primary":{"OTH":9.47,"IND":1.86,"ALP":32.7,"LIB":46.68,"GRN":9.28}},"held_by":"LIB","swing":{"OTH":-1.5,"IND":-1.9,"ON":25.4,"ALP":-20.0,"LIB":-6.0,"GRN":3.9},"prior":{"winner":"LIB","win_prob":0.9834998679803151,"final":[{"candidate":"Liberal","code":"LIB","pct":64.92456054879767},{"candidate":"Labor","code":"ALP","pct":35.07543945120233}],"primary":{"OTH":5.44,"IND":1.27,"ALP":17.09,"LIB":43.28,"GRN":12.57,"ON":20.36}},"projection":{"winner":"LIB","win_prob":0.948,"final":[{"candidate":"VALLENCE, Bridget","code":"LIB","pct":63.3},{"candidate":"KILLEY, Daniel","code":"ON","pct":36.7}],"basis":"preference model","sd":8.17,"on_win_prob":0.052,"live_weight":1.0}}